      },
      "worked": "Use the difference of squares identity.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a^2+ab+b^2&=(a+b)^2-ab\\\\a^2+ab+b^2&=(a+b)^2-(\\sqrt{ab})^2\\\\a^2+ab+b^2&=(a+b-\\sqrt{ab})(a+b+\\sqrt{ab})\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^2+ab+b^2}{a+\\sqrt{ab}+b}&=\\frac{(a+b-\\sqrt{ab})(a+b+\\sqrt{ab})}{a+b+\\sqrt{ab}}\\\\\\frac{a^2+ab+b^2}{a+\\sqrt{ab}+b}&=a+b-\\sqrt{ab}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
